flowchart TB
    b([Customer])
    gw[api-gateway]
    os[order-service]
    ps[payment-service]
    k[(Kafka)]
    is[inventory-service]
    ns[notification-service]
    b -->|1 POST /api/v1/orders/id/cancel| gw
    gw -->|2 route| os
    os -->|3 POST /internal/payments/id/refund| ps
    os -->|4 POST /internal/reservations/id/return| is
    os -->|5 commit CANCELLED + outbox row| os
    os -.->|6 order.events OrderCancelled| k
    k -.->|7 release anything still held| is
    k -.->|7 cancellation email| ns
